"Alis-art'h is the Primary's sister and an Artonan knight."
"Among the knight titles she ranks third, after the Primary and one other."
"By her Thegund posting she is named Loh Alis-art'h, the Quaternary."
"She has dark lavender hair and brown eyes, and is Stuart's aunt."
"She took the Thegund posting a week before bearing triplets, to escape newborn care."
"She cleanses chaos by Triforming, lifting vast amounts of soil and slamming it down."
"Her team rescued Alden Thorn and Kibby on Moon Thegund."
"She scorns Worli Ro-den for treating other species as disposable tools."
"She sent Alden to Artona I by Ritual of Return and asked Mother to save him."
"Earth's System calls her the Fourth General; Neha nicknames her Numero Cuatro."
"She has identical twin daughters with dark lavender hair."
"She commended Alden for exceptional bravery in the absence of obligation."
"She wants to bury Worli Ro-den, believing he takes advantage of young Avowed."
